posts.body:
Running into a huge problem with RPG Maker MV right now. I tried using the plugin from SRD called "Spell Check" (
http://sumrndm.site/spell-check/
), and found that it was a little buggy with my current textboxes. I turned it off, deleted the .js and associated .txt file for the dictionary, but now whenever I try to test play my game I get an error and the game window doesn't even open. I tried uninstalling MV several times and using a project back up. I just keep getting the same errors. All I can use is the editor, but I'm scared that'll break too. Please, someone help me.
